# Base URL of the Contextual RAG FastAPI backend.
#
# During local development, leave VITE_API_URL unset: the Vite dev/preview
# server forwards all `/api` requests to http://localhost:8000 (see the
# `server.proxy` block in vite.config.ts). This keeps the browser same-origin
# and avoids CORS entirely.
#
# Set VITE_API_URL only when the frontend is deployed separately from the API,
# e.g.:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-app.region.insforge.app